# API keys for AI background generation. Used when --use-ai-bg is on (the
# default when either key is present). Without keys, store-assets-gen falls
# back to deterministic CSS/SVG backgrounds — no signup required.
#
# Rename this file to `.env.local` and fill in whichever provider you use.
# The first key found here is used unless --provider overrides.
#
# DO NOT commit .env.local — keep it gitignored.

# OpenAI gpt-image-1
# Get a key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# Pricing: usage-based (no daily quota).
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Google Imagen
# Get a key at: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Pricing: ~70 free images/day on standard plans.
# GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY=
